"entity": {
"name": "Shurgard Self Storage Limited",
"description": "Shurgard Self Storage Ltd. engages in the acquisition, development and operation of self-storage facilities providing month-to-month leases for business and personal use. It also offers ancillary services at its self-storage properties consisting primarily of sales of storage products and protection of customers\u2019 stored goods. It operates through the Same Stores, and Non-same Stores segments. The Same Stores segment develops properties that have been in operation for at least three full years. The Non-same Stores segment includes properties that are not classified as same store for a given year. The company was founded in 1970 and is headquartered in St. Peters Port, the United Kingdom.",
